unless you have ad
blocker and turned it off.

00:02:13.170 --> 00:02:14.450
If that's the case, that's fine.

00:02:14.450 --> 00:02:15.320
I'm not picky about it.

00:02:15.320 --> 00:02:17.690
I'm making like $6 off
these videos anyways.

00:02:17.690 --> 00:02:20.420
Moral of the story is
everybody wants your attention.

00:02:20.420 --> 00:02:23.130
What this means for you is
if you spend a lot of time

00:02:23.130 --> 00:02:24.990
on the internet and around screens,

00:02:24.990 --> 00:02:28.300
inevitably your attention is
gonna be completely dispersed

00:02:28.300 --> 00:02:29.930
in a thousand different directions.

00:02:29.930 --> 00:02:31.940
And if you spend a long
enough time doing this,

00:02:31.940 --> 00:02:34.850
you start to get used to having
your attention fragmented.

00:02:34.850 --> 00:02:37.120
YouTube is a perfect example of this.

00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:38.950
Clickbait on YouTube is so powerful

00:02:38.950 --> 00:02:41.610
because of something called
supernormal stimulus.

00:02:41.610 --> 00:02:43.100
I'll put a link in the description

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:44.952
to my favorite comic on this.

00:02:44.952 --> 00:02:47.740
I mean, I don't read comics too often,

