on supernormal stimulus,

00:02:51.710 --> 00:02:54.810
what it is and how you
can fix it, or not fix it,

00:02:54.810 --> 00:02:56.300
it's just a phenomenon.

00:02:56.300 --> 00:02:57.770
It's a psychological phenomenon.

