00:03:11.860 --> 00:03:13.290
You can only output information.

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:15.620
This is obviously a very extreme example.

00:03:15.620 --> 00:03:17.300
And if you don't live like a Shaolin monk,

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:19.750
