00:03:23.560 --> 00:03:25.080
But it is a really cool concept.

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:26.830
And I still think you
should check the video out.

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:29.270
But what I think is a lot
more practical of a solution

00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:31.170
is to practice meditation.

00:03:31.170 --> 00:03:33.120
I know I talk about
meditation all the time,

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:34.730
but it's so powerful in this day and age

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:37.680
because people can't sit
still with themselves

00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:38.880
for more than five minutes.

00:03:38.880 --> 00:03:43.180
And it trains you to collect
this scattered focus of yours

00:03:43.180 --> 00:03:45.970
